{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1225,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6d6fd719ca2571dcd2b3a56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我做能让我赢的训练吧。\r\n无论是多么艰难的内容也没关系。",
      "source_fingerprint": "daf40589e551415e6a50775faa58eaf96a4908bdfb5b1ad05d027e4efdaf69ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9735e3c135957c5eeecea47a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微严苛一点的也可以哦。\r\n我心脏可是很强的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f498169843722dc6de3ef295e402ceed4c543ecf417f8777c15d296f271edbe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52cf1cc8008fdc79c0068a5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，小栗帽，\r\n要加油喔……开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0374df4cbe385556ee2883fc06e83320932ca8555bc9890bb88ae2cd488214b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a2b449b196303a4abb43452",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不能输给驯鹿……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd2aa4fbd906d5a91ba77aba6aa9eed808d2017594b93fc80f2150bdfe4bad13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9624d25492534f1f78c02f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了替我加油的大家……\r\n我就好好努力吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6625928f23f57ebe02f7c265bb33b042ad71610a4d74102fda706521feaadc36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:530129d738be1df10be929c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像奔驰于世界各地的\r\n圣诞老人……一样快……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d1107e3db61c0085d17b40dbdcc29139f58221275198fcb37ffb5bdea540d2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29e80689488312459f4143f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是我的粉丝送的衣服嘛。\r\n穿起来超舒服的。\r\n就用我的奔驰来回报大家……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac531a8e9bc3766b2c6a6bc7f914531a855368a0325c7ebbeba324d977368a3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51c223b402c2a699a68f1293",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我决定要送训练员什么了。\r\n我的胜利……这是最适合的礼物吧。\r\n而且还附赠搥背券喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ba534f7e39d25751d6d04e69c50d9d365db972978d04256c988a6211e42543",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e6098865a0e3d90bfe918c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，下次圣诞节，\r\n我想在故乡参加竞赛。\r\n……你的行程能配合吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f31b3b81c8f3704a41ead7bb8717f856a7b24aebba84a80d116b7e90cf0b2c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:747f1e1db9d9a53e6663f973",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……训练员，想听听你的意见。\n土手煮、炸串、五平饼50人份\n作为加餐……够吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "115c566497562ca358dbea736ffad869d433ed896aee3796802c30cdd9a0ec50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27cd7a8f42e27c85f4bd43dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "～～唔……呼……。\n等不及下一场比赛了……\n可以去跑，一圈吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc6348988277060990cf7e5641dcc75b5c09b361d8293d4e943629f846053456",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:570d68d01a5010c3fc9b0635",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站着奔跑……今后也要展示，\n和大家一起抓住的奇迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "836ca8f7d800b1100f3f6e9b9c8addee4d813e40e4b9f39e22719690c2017466",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2497fe8bd441cc6bae5b001",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还想和大家一起跑……！\n所以，这双脚是不会停下来的\n为了大家聚集的，晴空舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21237fa073cc1ca855ff76abbe9fc3a00fb175eb2cab93e6b81f43b73128e7ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c860e4f0a10ddbc457bc3bde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这背上背负着大家的应援……\n大家都在期望着我的胜利……。\n正因如此，必须要赢啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1711353831a9e0092d3c73c182ea7229179062c762e0e700e887a71a6e96fa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9daf72d7ff8ddbddb2a328ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在接受应援的过程中一直感受到的热度\n是存在的。『想赢』……是啊\n这是和大家一起找到的，我自己的愿望",
      "source_fingerprint": "537b5b9aa4d9e55f1279f65389b7f295f1e4269171df7bba4209512dae2ed612",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b946a50848d2a62c6a17646",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用这双脚去迎接胜利吧。\n赌上大家的，还有我自己的愿望。\n证明吧——“我在这里”",
      "source_fingerprint": "c85d2c96a5f4f9bcb2481011d2afede5a5969e556e1145248dde7d8616f75477",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12d41905dd6bf046390e3bff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……觉得能来到这里真是太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d21c36c50b8b094d0f9fb5740f8f51a1b334220eb374f87679068a0755be040",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ef0052bbb8a680e66a44c8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有达到训练员对我的期许吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e543906f8ebc204d2a7dc85c0592477ab23f66c89249b11139183dc7e72aa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a128dfc2f0bdb36e7e3912ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟你相遇……就是我的奇迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7baf18221b68e4e67356fbc3f91f2f6d3b1944a6fc8c92a49991d41abc255ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d1f65defa8e49b8469b77f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是最棒的礼物……谢谢你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d42f77ee3ff1dd20f6da989a18ca6db88408dbdb56755befe56fc206e84fa1ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a67074c8a946bf406112852",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这颗星星，将与你共此辉煌。……永远。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a666af7b7383cf63efb763acbc562f8538bff25f74aee651c6d939a82616f255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53fd1b99d26fc0f64fb9d023",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家的梦想，实现了哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3923c4c802157f05e00223882db9399dfc02db9fadd9c93a19633dfbea1fad7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7ab124a7060b33e84cc03a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是信息吗……有点害羞呢……\n如果你有什么想传达的，就尽管发送给我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a29bc6a3e485349a65676855e54557fbf0bc9def38b3a1dfff404e4bceb26d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad4c93322aee1df59d07571f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你们发来这么多的信息。\n我都不知道该怎么感谢才好……我会全部珍重地阅读的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dda4b1f722fe33adb6bd6b9b8b0c1b795a92e75cfe85e58c55089d38b5cee4ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6eabebcdfd109fac12db969",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……感觉不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "049120d50a0028f87575eadbba4b2aba3a45cee4374a9d8d9b9fae028e138d23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccba64af5a1d94ecfda99bf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……感觉能跑更快了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aa3b53bf311b61f83268a8d289071c652d34c80081ff988e9c7bc48c58fc51d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c45e2cf1ab6a9ecf0b509b00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是小栗帽，请多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e2146ca6315ba6c9bc56d06a8fff3dbea6264d432908c66f21b52a8cf3fc948",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3188e3a925f60367a08d9426",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了跑出最棒的表现……\r\n这就是我在这里的目的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5f2e4e203b8343a9ef7e4a25a9b1ce08399ab881eccd5344f04a8243d40e230",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0923b51fe69dc3a412438b3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为你的助力，我会更加努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a077cea17577a39e1e8ffb1a524501276508ae4d8bea024492cedd87d1493bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87e4a4027cabff8f509a16cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像能成为你更大的助力了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24cccc38fd7cfee35df9bfd3eba62e80152f53ba95023ac3ab49598cd95baa00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee8beeaed0f482e67178759f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把大家的心愿……化为力量……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f7daa1ed5400afe16b663ae3b83ec8a34fdb74eb5253e208c79031c221f38e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:513da619c240f09dff065f32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会发出像星星一样的光芒，\r\n让大家看见奇迹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abdc614b4d2be6406c10ea74ee0a266a441fefdf0611d3e2679ff422e2c1810d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b93151ca4227d3c285f80fc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐──\r\n我是来跟你一起实现愿望的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7b8c46777c7fab5dea1d8f4ed93ccca4e6b55ce7aaf32f33788cc409d031dd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62c9cef64746ab6f2ecff34a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是小栗帽。\r\n我要将最棒的礼物送到大家手上……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f718c0e191c02da1bbd8d78b83004c03dacce3501fa26e75395c5182d926d1b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ac2efd891f2e3b142d240c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有人，推了我的后背一把……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b49bdc177b29ff9af59f71427fa2c0bfba433257d951593576a330eb83d587b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c47841e0010fc960070027e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多少次，\n我都会重生给你看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7584b14ab4aa3d4576c88616398c3a197477106da479ecf08992be5285d1902e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13cece97f20a44add4193ba4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢。\n——这句话，就是全部。",
      "source_fingerprint": "236251ab4aea13ac0a4549ad9e0f59498fa1d212cff3c2ffd275a7af210cfaec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e3f622c8714096a4f5c4170",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼唤我了吗？那么。小栗帽，出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb4c80dd7a62bef272263b3155d14261e714150c33b7ec74adf8ab502c47172a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cac89abc0d5679eee589648",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟着我金船大人来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16d936b1d8ea62955ca5745ba78e5eddc8a0f3a5dd2f7159284079a0b7c42108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31fe610277d7bb68b390853e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐，100年后有空吗？\n有空的话就去宇宙吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66531094b36fea799e34c6d248231420d38a95f9d5a32240af995215c556d289",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ac2fb479ce3816d4058f9b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3115702bd0decee3e50903caab119dd6ada22561c0b0ebcebe95c1c183da809",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:968a0d5ed1a064e89b956561",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰ったぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c4dc33b15ed7cfb4ccb62c3f325bde6c95aeb8ef8485aa2fa6d7522d06c2cd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d432b7b031626c09be0914e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你这不是越来越能干了嘛。\n第三天的佃煮完成了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd64545293b4cee611ed972b775dfc317dde92bf1fcc45d562d7cd7db91db93f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90d34a378b333312dbbc74c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要把目光从小金船身上移开哦！\n1秒之后会变得怎样\n我可也不知道！",
      "source_fingerprint": "356b902356ae16dad37518c890318ab5fe7bc51315a6992010a8589979afd771",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bbc0df914aa1ad2460a4e8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贺正！迎春！谨贺新年！\n让我带着一富士二鹰三茄子，\n朝你小子的初梦突击吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a12480fab93298a54cb7f2832167ae1d3f73b0373fedb43fa29e4e688aee22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02964868023f6e4cb650ced4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐，巧克力味木炭和\n木炭味巧克力的话，\n你觉得哪个比较好？",
      "source_fingerprint": "748d2ad30155c9a4524ae20a8ace6681dbcd785e31670ed0a869e8621d1e0387",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17b2d6dee971cd42e69e094c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐☆哟～\n请好好品尝，我亲手制作的…\n金・枪・鱼・刺・身★",
      "source_fingerprint": "92b543e24d3e4cd8bf10f1ee9c0895b1187ff862918893da0f09242c500b9c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00be8bf1c2196881ffd075f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1年只能见1次面…吗。\n是我的话就得准备\n银河爆发级别的超级惊喜了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b66aeb5d659830e1b81846a8f836f695385063cc50cb72e82c7ef63b77c7cb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22bd0182fefd881ae71774a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖，就…\n连续射门！！\n欧拉！现在马上来踢球吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a923577cd2523d38e2471f6525387a622276503cf7e1a8bb85e3bf65dfb98138",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3234f8cfb878db5ca74ea7c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍里那些年纪小的小鬼们，\n每年收到圣诞老人的来信都会很开心。\n虽然是我随便写的就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49bc86668cdf1cabae76cce2d5e2e4c0a254072a3d4b9b517b572bad2c71995d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d47bcd964c548a7c11597881",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的房间，没有烟囱吧？\nOk！那么首先\n开个洞再入侵吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "65cff6e5226220a4c215a2b97b17c8751aa73c205d573fb4ef8ec032c9fa5f62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42f7c069c6f160166e4bfd24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大致上就是这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4d70100648bf84b7973332fbfffe399a104e8d37b5d0415693aa363b4096a3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f432786738a012d11ae41ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和除夕的钟声一决胜负！！\n我的脑袋里装满了烦恼，\n能净化的话就来试试吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "653c075c28c2f12e528507679ac56be15ade6243c07d862cab2bde528e0bac80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7eb3107218047d088288e94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭喜恭喜，太阳彻底升起来了啊。\n把和一年数量一样的自动笔芯。\n到明年用完吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "459778a5b14694f60a29b00ed32559f2efa2c69fff3693420a3be6aa961b0c4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0ee93d6680b4c2a23fa55d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。因为很闲\n把屋里的米糠送你吧。\n把米糠腌菜…做给我看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ed16ac5eaafd9375457d939cc4eaf05228b2a40185f9094a3899a98dbf80e6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1634d9cfb0d26d4f59dfd376",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日，吗…我究竟几岁了呢――啊不妙，\n这是不能接触的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0b00fd1fe12bb6a715ddf88de6029952ef0a34f9492017754438e208804fc15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f814fe0f541c62e0ff6566f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是生日所以是一生的愿望！\n让我拿推子把你的头\n剪成短发吧…！请务必…！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff920191836cbc2f4a7987537a72c9c9ec83491515bf625b08f856bbb1563e40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f9e3793dcaef0b0ac158846",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "bing—bong—bang—bong♪\n有通知哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "34fa37505798c95fe9f3ccd1ebd3353e53c08bc03ae158e4412b9a1914febbc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbcff1cbfeabae196b809b3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是礼物啊。\n把拿到的东西也分我点呗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1af99043cb95d3b301264ecbdab5ace4651bbc27915a6e697e3b732ebf5c09a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641f980c71e8d3d31df3f615",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，总觉得结束了啊。\n虽然不知道具体是什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10428e639d39021ca7b435e3b5a1a1a46af5cb800df359399e2a0145edba69e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2290e9f83d7ee88119dea56e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哦哦哦哦ーー！！\n等不及了！活动！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd98ed93ad30955824aaf3bf74dd392887892e12f024f144ae5f4a9f58ebb36b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daa01db57d51ea4f41a6ce05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，正在办活动啊！\n过去看看吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87141550b784ee71d753bda07a9e94d9b76eaae3be70b47b5670233f8a68deab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc61ff3fef7d89e7d009871b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "库唔，呜咳…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1384ad93e998a0174b575881277ee296f81c6ce11dd597ca707ee27659749451",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f94ca5d4ab4ce9693d7bb13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，名鉴等级什么的\n貌似提升了啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "864e4e592e6726a1afc193573d6b01e162788dedd4a2f9f14eef885c9943e706",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92099fe4201e2ccdcf9bd946",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢这套方便行动的衣服。\r\n不但能和小鬼头们玩∞鬼抓人，\r\n就算被陆上的鲨鱼攻击也能应战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53324d17cd46b09e395e8f1daf1528aeaf638cd7f2ffd204114968a6a43091ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:464e84574395d17aca09c27f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前在街上有间某某经纪公司的家伙\r\n递了张名片给我，所以我就送给对方\r\n有明海苔当作回礼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c4240ac79ebccf6fb8c9f546413eae1d8732d582aba32d8d5646adcad076d77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70ce258d3eb3df90b6087869",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂喂喂，我们找个地方去玩吧～\r\n像是艾菲尔铁塔、马丘比丘、\r\n月球、土星或我家之类的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77bd90bde10114a18e12f0d7d5032ce00e27065f6f965aa3cc2e9007c3db1f76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:599ee2b139a86d83c96e1f7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛真激烈啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b9d3694fa78289771512895745724b786284c26e8fbcb9a29acdf6b221f6064",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc73b53df0e75ea129eb09db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，那是当然！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcd1b9d112ca52b73a70b6a67b03949af829794bbdc55948934b15a9b0ebfe7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06fe34ec558ec229f89f71dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "库唔，呜咳…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1384ad93e998a0174b575881277ee296f81c6ce11dd597ca707ee27659749451",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ad7553fa3be142cac532158",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛真激烈啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b9d3694fa78289771512895745724b786284c26e8fbcb9a29acdf6b221f6064",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9322378438e05b6f4486631d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样，是新记录哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09a21bbb611a5bb0998da1c6e147d03abf28c1b593fb0ffb8b43ceab17823bbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06817de1667f5ea9d176660",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青春啊ー！朝着大海奔跑吧ー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4fc32a9bf7fe3ec5719e51ddeee035992faf6d0eb43713177d412fedaf78985",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f716e34898fd8fd6420c47b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给我泡茶吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e0e52ce338f0bbdd97c4780a3dffdea20e47999e349feb2f7c480369aa64e7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "1021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:240c51ee2c3c4341c2af6eb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ae3e5dcae9a53056d19b3106de1996e8c400c410dfd1c96cb651012cfebc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "1022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269f4165889a3bfb621103cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6727081be9474e89e57a360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，要训练吗？\n好嘞，目标是！将棋王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f6b69d326e67f84f8a9ef65bdfacddc9ba2b54f7693f2dc5db2c73cdc4113f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:722cd5eb2a1b1a61aea624b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是回忆吗…一起在\n深海中度过的7天，\n真怀念啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1d5bdc12b1ea8b015d3d238ea9a6be19029750f2a983648f806be3a187b3047",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c681d68742127423981ef84f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要来一场有趣的比赛吗～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e6bea4af137efbca390ffb2f4373ae0eefba89e80d7e3e7c43c9f03b10e280e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d6a412de7907158672a3252",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，抽鬼牌吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6e97e31d4dccf4afb53ea1e04062c4e401d45c246a9b8d0d37a2216497b971b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "1103"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
